<title>UK: HTV seals production alliance with Warner.</title>
<headline>HTV seals production alliance with Warner.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>HTV Group Plc and Warner Bros. International Television Production have formed a non-exclusive production alliance to produce television projects, HTV said in a statement on Sunday.</p>
<p>HTV gave no details of the terms of the deal, but last week a newspaper report suggested it is worth million of pounds and involves three series.</p>
<p>HTV will announced its full year results on March 4.</p>
</text>
